<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: blunt -->
  <AM_Armour_Blunt.label>钝器</AM_Armour_Blunt.label>
  <!-- EN: Defense is paramount to any military strategy. We will be like a bulwark that stops all attacks our enemies try to direct against us.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Colonists wearing any kind of apparel will get +25% blunt armour bonus. -->
  <AM_Armour_Blunt.description>防护对任何军事行动来说都无比重要，我们将把自身武装成能抵御敌人一切攻击的坚固壁垒。\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C>游戏效果：&lt;/color>\n - 穿戴着任意衣物的殖民者将额外获得+25%钝器护甲的加成。</AM_Armour_Blunt.description>
  <!-- EN: No metallic armor -->
  <AM_Armour_Blunt.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>没有金属护甲</AM_Armour_Blunt.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Strong armor -->
  <AM_Armour_Blunt.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>坚固的护甲</AM_Armour_Blunt.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  
  <!-- EN: forbidden -->
  <AM_Armour_Forbidden.label>禁忌</AM_Armour_Forbidden.label>
  <!-- EN: Armor is forbidden. I will never hide my body behind clothing or armor. The body must remain exposed, for there is nothing shameful about our natural form.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Colonists can't equip ANY apparel. -->
  <AM_Armour_Forbidden.description>护甲对我们而言乃禁忌之物。我们绝不会将身体藏于衣物或护甲之后。身体必须要保持裸露，因为我们的自然形态并无可耻之处。\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C>游戏效果：&lt;/color>\n - 殖民者无法穿戴任何衣物。</AM_Armour_Forbidden.description>
  
